cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its outputs, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Code and assumed results for: Development and Research of Reliable Information Retrieval Methods for Kazakh-Language Question Answering Systems Based on External Knowledge Sources"
abstract: >-
  Seeded simulation (master seed 2026) of a planned study of Kazakh legal
  retrieval-augmented question answering, with its outputs. No experiment has
  been run: every reported mean is an author-specified target reached by
  calibration, and the pattern of significant and non-significant tests is
  pre-specified (DESIGNED in src/simulate.py). The outputs illustrate the
  planned analysis and contain no empirical information. The retrieval and
  generation pipeline will be added when the experiments are run.
